WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.970
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.970
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
Keep your eyes on me, okay?!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:36.110
I am Kurata Sana, a first year in
middle school.

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:38.570
I 'm turning 13 soon, although I
don't really want to.

00:01:39.070 --> 00:01:42.910
Child's Toy Rises
from the Dead

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:45.080
Good morning, everyone.

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:48.000
- Hisae-chan, morning.
- Morning!

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:53.380
Looks like you're in a pretty good
mood, did you get a love letter?

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:54.420
What's this?!

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:57.260
This is the old way of saying love letter.

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:00.470
Tadah, look at the video I bought.

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:02.430
Wow, Sana's video.

00:02:03.310 --> 00:02:06.140
Mami-chan said you guys
bought it too, right?

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:08.350
That's right, it's really funny.

00:02:08.350 --> 00:02:10.560
Fuka-chan should have
some credit too, right?

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:14.320
The reason the video was taped
successfully because you worked really...

00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:16.240
Not really, anyone can teach math.

00:02:16.240 --> 00:02:21.950
The most important reason the video turned out well is because of Sana's strength.

00:02:21.950 --> 00:02:23.870
Sana is really talented.

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:25.120
That's true.

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:28.870
But this way Sana-chan will be busy again.

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:31.580
The chance to see her at school
will decrease.

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:33.380
Maybe she'll be absent today.

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:34.500
Probably.

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:38.720
Yeah, it would be really loud if
she were here.

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:43.680
But if her seat were empty it would feel like something was missing.

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:47.640
- Sana.
- Good morning.

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:49.270
Aren't you suppose to be
at a recording?

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:51.350
Do you have time
to come to school?

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:55.150
When are you going to start being
absent? We can help you copy notes.

00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:57.900
I already decided not to be absent.

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:00.030
Is it because...

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:01.910
No, no, no!

00:03:01.910 --> 00:03:04.160
That media thing is already over.

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:06.410
A rumor will disappear after
49 days, right?

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:08.750
49 is unlucky. It is only 45 days.

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:10.040
Really?

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:14.540
I've already decided to be absent
as little as possible.

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:15.920
Is it really possible?

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:17.920
I will try.

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:21.760
Well... if that's what you decided,
then we will try to help you.

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:25.600
Thank you all!

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:27.060
But...

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:28.430
Though the media thing has ended...

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:28.520
But...

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:29.980
Excuse me!

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:32.900
Please help out
Kurata Sana's case.

00:03:33.190 --> 00:03:36.230
The show's cast is already set,
sorry.

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:37.730
Please look at this!

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:41.360
It' Kurata Sana's latest project,
it got very good reviews.

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:45.070
Oh, that, I'll watch it...

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:48.700
...but don't expect too much.
I'm not an expert in the acting business.

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:51.910
Kurata Sana has been reincarnated,
please give her a chance.

00:03:51.910 --> 00:03:54.830
She'll soon become number one
around the neighborhood again.

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:56.590
Around the neighborhood?

00:03:56.590 --> 00:04:00.210
Things people like change very fast.
You can't really guess what it will be next.

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:05.340
Of course Sana-chan is quite outstanding don't misunderstand... Sagami-chan

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:07.310
Thank you.

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:11.060
Rei-kun!

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:13.520
Sorry for making you wait.

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:17.900
Today I'm on cleaning duty, it
took me some time to get to it but...

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:20.530
...this is the true way a middle
school student's life should be.

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:21.780
I feel very relaxed.

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:25.620
I finished all the things I needed to do,
even the air smells very fresh.

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:28.530
From now on I need to work harder.

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:30.410
I missed all of these.

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:31.750
Listen to me. Sana-chan.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:33.960
What?

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:38.040
You can't find any jobs, right?
I already know that.

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:41.920
I already knew it was a cold world.

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:43.300
Sana-chan.

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:44.720
Why are you feeling so gloomy?

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:48.550
Seems like the wind of the South Pole gave you a sad face. This isn't like you.

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:52.310
Work harder, let's go visit
everyone together.

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:55.940
To return all my fans' support
I can't give up.

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:57.310
Sana-chan.

00:04:57.310 --> 00:04:58.560
- Rei-kun...
- Yes?

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:00.980
Don't cry when you hold my hand,
I feel embarrassed.

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:05.070
You guys, wait a minute.

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:07.530
Are you talking to us?

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:12.200
Who else? You guys are blocking my way. Get away.

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:14.830
- We're blocking you.
- Of course.

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:17.960
You guys are standing at the
entrance. Of course we can't get in.

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:20.710
Ah, aren't you Kurata Sana?

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:22.590
It really is Sana.

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:24.840
Sana... Hana... who cares what na...

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:29.260
Doesn't she know he's blocking the
way by standing there?

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:32.180
Today's teenagers...

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:34.060
Sorry...

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:37.230
...but it says if not an official
worker, please do not enter.

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:39.270
I am an official worker.

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:40.820
Offcial worker?

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:42.690
Are you really?

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:46.030
Everyone, we're going to be late.
Hurry up.

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:47.490
Yes!

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:59.540
Really like what Sana-chan said, old ladies who often become the topic are really scary.

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:00.960
Horrible.

00:06:04.170 --> 00:06:07.630
It is
'Old Ladies Toy'

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:07.680
Words are too big,
Babbit gets squeezed out.

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:10.090
So, let's start our lesson.

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:12.310
Everyone, long time no see.

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:13.310
The boss of all is...

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:16.430
Zenjiro, what are you getting
wordy about?

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:20.650
Sorry, so today's first class
will be Japanese.

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:22.650
First, let's learn correct
Japanese.

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:25.740
Learn Japanese?

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:28.360
We need to learn our own country's
language?

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:32.450
Hey, it was hard to memorize this line.

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:35.370
If you keep behaving like this,
we can't make the show.

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:39.830
What are you talking about? It's
your job to keep the show going.

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:40.960
Right?

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:45.210
Are you saying that our Japanese
isn't correct?

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:49.180
I didn't mean that.

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:51.800
If you talk to us like this,
we won't forgive you.

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:53.640
Your Osakan accent is not bad.

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:55.640
I can do it too.

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:58.600
Listen to this, put your hand into
your mouth.

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:00.560
Not bad, quite amazing.

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:06.530
Everyone, let's have PE instead of
language class.

00:07:06.530 --> 00:07:08.190
That's good.

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:10.200
Then let's practice by ourselves.

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:13.490
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:15.620
Go!

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:27.340
Second period is calligraphy!

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:30.970
The ink doesn't stick well.

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:40.730
I was wondering how
Zenjiro-sensei was doing,

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:42.810
I didn't know it was this sad.

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:45.440
This kind of job is way too cruel.

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:48.440
Let's listen to the tape he
gave us last week again.

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:52.030
Sana-chan... help me.

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:53.910
So this is why.

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:55.120
Finally, it makes sense.

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:56.740
I finished buying these.

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:59.950
This is anti-throwing up
medicine...

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:04.250
The medical center gave me
the most effective ones.

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:07.500
Sane-yan, I can't do this anymore.

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:09.340
What are you talking about,
Zen-chan?

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:11.090
This is better than be pushed down
from a lighthouse...

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:13.720
...or being dressed like a skunk
being hung from the corner of the house.

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:15.590
And not to mention,
the other party is human.

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:17.260
Do you need vitamins?

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:22.180
Work harder, you have another hour,
then today's work is all done.

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:25.270
I don't fit this kind of job.

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:27.610
I really can't. I quit.

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:29.610
They got my weakness.

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:34.160
If I keep going on like this...
I will die.

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:37.450
You will die if you stop at
the middle.

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:40.660
This is the only job you have
right now.

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:45.290
If you don't do it... how you deal
with rent and food?

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:48.130
I will die whether I do it or not
anyway.

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:51.010
You can say it like that. But it's
not completely like that.

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:54.930
- I have had enough of this kind of living.
- So what kind of living is good?

00:08:55.430 --> 00:08:56.640
Sana-chan.

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:57.850
Zenjiro-sensei.

00:08:57.850 --> 00:09:01.470
- Sana-chan!
- Looks like you have... no energy.

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:05.600
Being stepped on by those old
ladies can't be good for anyone.

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:10.400
If you don't like those old ladies want to find another way of living?

00:09:10.780 --> 00:09:13.940
Together we make a strong team.

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:15.820
Let's work hard to find a job.

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:18.660
Where can we find a job?

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:21.200
Instead of worrying here about it,
why don't we go find one?

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:23.830
Where there is a will,
there is a way.

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:26.080
What are you talking about?

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:29.380
It should be 70% hard work and
30% luck.

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:31.130
My hand...

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:34.420
Right, attack while we are on top
so we can get to the heart of this.

00:09:34.420 --> 00:09:38.680
Separated we're weak, but together, nothing will scare us.

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:41.720
That also means that three
shoemaker's together is better than one wise man.

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:43.890
That is really a good phrase.

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:47.940
Take your bow to thank the
audience.

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:53.820
- Let's cheer each other on.
- Yes.

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:56.740
Looking for a job
right now

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:56.740
If it's raining, then they can't work.

00:09:57.240 --> 00:10:01.370
Prince... I will die if I keep
going like this.

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:05.290
That's ok, don't worry about
not having a job.

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:06.910
Kurata Sana, Zenjiro.

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:09.500
- In and out together.
- We still have the saved files.

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:11.500
Next.

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:13.630
If you fall down, get back up.

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:14.760
Yes, coach.

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:18.720
From now on, we'll start marching
toward our goal of tv stardom.

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:20.640
- Yes!
- Ok, ok.

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:22.680
Next one.

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:25.560
We will do what you expect.

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:27.940
Kurata Sana, Zenjiro,
pleased to meet you.

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:29.190
Let's talk another time.

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:33.480
Don't run, thief.

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:36.570
Hey-ho, hey-ho.

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:40.360
How come it's like this?

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:42.320
Zen-chan...

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:46.000
What happened?
You don't look good.

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:48.660
It's because...

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:51.880
What? 'Old ladies Toy'
has been canceled?

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:55.670
Why?
I thought the rating were good.

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:57.720
Yeah. Weird, isn't it?

00:10:58.050 --> 00:11:03.680
Because the old ladies are complaining that partnering up with Zenjiro is not interesting.

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:04.970
What?!

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:10.190
They also said since they're TV people, they hope to work with a handsome man.

00:11:10.810 --> 00:11:16.940
So they want to find that big
martial arts star, Dai Gu Shan

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:22.030
to play the show
Old Ladies Baby together.

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:29.370
I've been working so hard.

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:31.170
I am over.

00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:33.380
There are always ups and
downs in life.

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:35.340
You've got to have the courage
to fight on.

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:38.710
Finished, I have no courage left to
strive on.

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:40.420
It's all over.

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:42.260
It's all broken!

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:43.720
Zenjiro-sensei.

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:47.220
My life is all over!

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:51.310
- Zenjiro-sensei!
- Zenjiro-san!

00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:53.690
- Damn it.
- What are you doing?

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:55.650
This is bad!

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:01.610
Someone we missed

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:01.650
Guess who this is!

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:12.670
{parte b}

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:25.180
Babbit band, Hawaaiian quartet life song

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:22.470
Dad leaves early and comes back late. So does sister.

00:12:22.470 --> 00:12:29.270
Mom only has television and
friends. This is a perfect family.

00:12:29.270 --> 00:12:36.020
Isn't this great? Isn't this
great? Isn't this great?

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:39.530
Life like this...
isn't that great?

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:43.650
Tsu the prouducer

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:43.650
Do you remember him?

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:45.990
I'm very sorry.

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:47.320
I'm really sorry.

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:50.490
Sana -chan,
you don't have to apologize.

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:52.120
I'm the one who is wrong.

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:56.330
No, I'm the one who encouraged you
to find acting jobs.

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:58.840
- It's not like that.
- It is.

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:00.130
No, it isn't.

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:05.970
Yes. So this is your fault.

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:10.560
You are as funny as before.

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:13.560
You remind me of 'Child's Toy' from before.

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:20.190
I need to make a new show plan, but this kind of good idea is hard to find.

00:13:20.190 --> 00:13:22.860
So this is it!
You don't need to find it.

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:25.030
Let us act in 'Child's Toy'.

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:26.490
We can't.

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:27.950
Of course we can.

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:31.950
If Tsu-san will help us?

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:33.330
This appears again...

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:35.830
Sana's non-seductive seduction as
an attack plan.

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:39.210
But we still need to see if the
plan will pass in the meeting.

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:40.670
Tsu-san doesn't have enough
experience.

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:42.300
You really don't want to help us?

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:45.630
The attack of 'Child's Toy'!
If coaxing doesn't work, then use threats.

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:47.800
We only have the path of death if
you don't help us.

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:50.050
Cruel producer.

00:13:50.050 --> 00:13:52.220
You're just watching us walk down
the path of ruin.

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:53.970
I will come to
haunt you.

00:13:53.970 --> 00:13:57.640
Alright, I will help
at tomorrow's meeting.

00:13:57.640 --> 00:13:59.650
Thank you, Tsu-san.

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:03.860
But the proposal, can you finish it
by tomorrow?

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:05.360
Proposal?

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:06.780
It's written like this.

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:06.820
Proposal

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:08.910
Wood, hornbook...

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:11.030
You wrote the first two words
incorrectly.

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:13.540
Are you sure you can really do it?

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:15.830
You should write prettier.

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:19.080
At this time, it's important to
use first person.

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:23.130
It's ok. If you care too much about little things then, we can't finish the big things.

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:25.300
Can you hand write it?

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:28.260
- We should type it because that's neater.
- Right.

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:32.850
Hi, Kurata Misako speaking.

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:34.350
I am a writer, Sana's mother.

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:37.230
Sana? Please wait a second.

00:14:38.810 --> 00:14:42.560
It looks like she is busy with the
proposal that is due tomorrow.

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:44.190
She can't talk right now.

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:46.400
Really? I understand.

00:14:48.820 --> 00:14:50.530
Proposal?

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:53.780
Hello.

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:56.540
Is this Akito? It's me.

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:58.710
Yo. What is it?

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:02.670
It's daylight! Even though it's still early in the morning.

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:05.130
I failed again.

00:15:06.260 --> 00:15:09.300
Add some more, we need more impact...

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:11.300
You need to impress people.

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:15.810
Not only the voice, but even
Hayama's image appeared.

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:17.470
It's me.

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:20.310
Hayama, what are you doing in
my house?

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:22.020
Because I told everyone to come.

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:22.900
Fuka!

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:25.440
- We are also here.
- Aya-chan and Tsuyoshi-kun?

00:15:25.570 --> 00:15:29.900
Fuka-chan said you were ready to
study hard, so everybody came to help you.

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:33.370
Damn, this is annoying, woke me up
so early the morning.

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:36.830
So you came to help me?

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:39.250
Long live friendship.

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:42.120
I am so glad that I could be with
Tsuyoshi-kun in the morning.

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:44.080
I should say thanks to you.

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:46.420
- Aya-chan!
- Tsuyoshi-kun!

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:50.010
Everywhere you guys go you are all
over each other.

00:15:50.340 --> 00:15:53.050
So, let's start working.

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:57.850
Hayama, what are you doing?

00:15:58.270 --> 00:16:00.270
Open the workbook here.

00:16:00.270 --> 00:16:01.730
Wait a sec!

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:03.690
What, Sana-chan?

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:09.360
I am really thankful you came to help me but I need to finish 2 or 3 hours.

00:16:10.490 --> 00:16:13.990
This is why I told everyone to come.

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:16.030
Let us worry about the proposal...

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:18.870
...you and Akito practice solving
math problems.

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:21.620
Isn't proposal spelled incorrectly?

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:25.040
Learning!      Working!

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:25.040
In the morning, so sleepy.

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:27.960
Ok!

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:29.550
I finished.

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:31.380
I only have a little bit left.

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:35.340
Not like this! How am I going to make you understand, you chicken head?

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:36.890
Chicken head?

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:39.890
Because chickens only have
3 seconds of memory.

00:16:40.390 --> 00:16:43.140
I only have 3 seconds of memory?
Cluck, cluck, cluck.

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:46.900
I am going to teach you again so
listen carefully.

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:48.650
This problem is like this...

00:16:53.530 --> 00:16:57.910
You got the answer,
you are so smart.

00:16:57.910 --> 00:17:00.120
It's because you are too stupid.
Next is...

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:01.700
Ok.

00:17:01.700 --> 00:17:05.000
They say that they're only good
friends forever...

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:07.920
...but it's very clear that they
like each other.

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:09.130
Finished.

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:10.340
Really?

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:16.970
Really? The cover is red because
we want it to look special.

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:18.220
Thank you.

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:21.140
Kurata Sana and Zenjiro gives you
the feeling of wanting to laugh.

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:23.390
Excellent, excellent.

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:26.310
We hope Sana can shine gloriously.

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:28.400
We have a lot of hopes for you.

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:30.900
Thank you all.

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:34.360
I am also burning with the will to fight.

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:36.150
Suddenly falling asleep.

00:17:36.150 --> 00:17:38.870
This is not the time to sleep!

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:41.160
What time is it?

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:43.830
Alright.
Let's go, Zenjiro-sensei.

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:46.580
Alright.
Let's go, Sana-chan

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:48.000
Let's go!

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:50.250
- Alright.
- Stop already.

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:53.920
This time's topic is exactly youth
and perseverance.

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:56.090
You don't have to cry.

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:03.020
This is the proposal we made for the resurrection of our 'Child's Toy'.

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:09.310
Be careful. These animals are headed for the Tokyo Zoo.{checar}

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:12.020
Quick, quick, we need to run.

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:17.610
Quick, eh?

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:19.450
Run, run.

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:20.700
Sana-chan, be careful.

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:21.990
What's it?

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:34.300
The proposal is pinned on the horn
of the bull that is now running away.

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:37.340
What kind of proposals are these?

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:40.220
These are all rough drafts,
they're not even creative.

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:42.800
How can these get sponsors and the audience's applause?

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:44.060
We...

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:45.100
Don't find an excuse.

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:47.100
Can't you think of some new ideas?

00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:49.100
Who is this big-shot old man?

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:51.230
- I am the chief.
- Indeed a big-shot.

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:53.190
- Umm...
- You are all idiots!

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:55.900
What are your brains really
thinking about?

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:58.280
What happened to Sana-chan's proposal?

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:01.240
Wait a minute.

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:06.290
Wait a minute,
give me back my proposal.

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:08.120
So that's all the hope that...

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:11.580
Wait a minute!

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:15.000
I will not give up!

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:21.430
Don't stop all of a sudden.

00:19:24.390 --> 00:19:25.760
Ouch.

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:28.350
The proposal is gone, where is it?

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:29.690
It's there!

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:33.650
Ahh, wait.

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:38.490
Stop!

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:44.700
- Sorry, mister, we're trying to find...
- Sana-chan, that dog, that dog.

00:19:48.910 --> 00:19:50.620
This time it's the dog.

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:52.370
Let me do it!

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:55.540
Sagami Cycle!

00:19:56.000 --> 00:19:57.250
Sagami Cycle?

00:19:57.500 --> 00:20:01.090
Union of bike racers, number 253,
Sagami Rei.

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:03.550
I will not miss my chance!

00:20:04.930 --> 00:20:05.970
Got it.

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:08.770
Looks like you don't know what
will happen next, after you've grabbed it.

00:20:09.470 --> 00:20:11.560
Waa, please stop.

00:20:11.850 --> 00:20:13.480
So annoying.

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:16.060
My name is Sagami Rei.

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:23.490
Hey, proposal, proposal!

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:28.160
This proposal means
life or death for me!

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:29.660
For me too.

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:32.960
Superman... but where is it going?{mangojan}

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:36.250
It stopped.
Isn't that the TV studio?

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:39.130
A lively proposal will create a
lively actor.

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:41.920
Are there
any admirable actors now?

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:43.430
Still angry?

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:46.260
- Yes, there are.
- For example!

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:51.560
That video! My grandson really likes the
actress in that video.

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:52.980
Hmm? Video...

00:20:52.980 --> 00:20:53.770
Can it be...

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:57.900
That, that...
I can't remember the name...

00:20:57.900 --> 00:20:59.780
Oh, it's Math Teacher...

00:20:59.980 --> 00:21:01.360
Math?

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:03.990
It's that cute, lively,
outgoing personality

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:08.070
who makes people feel she is
a sparking girl. I really like her.

00:21:08.070 --> 00:21:10.870
It's really hard to have her play
two people at once.

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:14.540
- It's...
- What?

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:15.920
Don't be so wimpy.

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:18.040
Her name is Kurata Sana-chan.

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:19.380
Kurata Sana?

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:21.590
- It's heavy...
- Sana-chan, are you done yet?

00:21:21.590 --> 00:21:22.800
Hurry up!

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:25.130
Higher, higher!

00:21:27.470 --> 00:21:28.470
Got it.

00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:30.310
Can't hold you it any more...

00:21:34.940 --> 00:21:38.560
Bring that Kurata Sana here
quickly!

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:44.610
Who are you?

00:21:44.860 --> 00:21:46.530
Sana-chan?

00:21:47.410 --> 00:21:49.410
She is Kurata Sana.

00:21:49.410 --> 00:21:50.240
That is her?

00:21:50.240 --> 00:21:53.040
Yeah, she's the little girl in
the video.

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:54.620
It is decided, she is chosen.

00:21:55.910 --> 00:21:56.960
Approved

00:21:59.630 --> 00:22:02.750
I missed this set.

00:22:03.210 --> 00:22:05.420
I really missed it.

00:22:05.880 --> 00:22:08.010
Am I dreaming?

00:22:08.010 --> 00:22:09.640
Sorry!

00:22:09.640 --> 00:22:12.560
We did it, Sana-chan, right?

00:22:12.560 --> 00:22:14.140
Zenjiro-sensei!

00:22:14.140 --> 00:22:15.520
Sana-chan!

00:22:15.520 --> 00:22:17.270
We came back.

00:22:17.730 --> 00:22:18.850
Everybody!

00:22:18.850 --> 00:22:21.820
Uchiyamada! Did you get fatter?

00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:40.000
matte  mou wakaretai no yo

00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:40.000
"Wait... I want us to split up", I said

00:22:40.670 --> 00:22:45.260
ima  KISU wo sorashinagara itta

00:22:40.670 --> 00:22:45.260
Just now, when I turned away from your kiss

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.760
Gutto  tsukihanasu kono me ni

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.760
Under the gaze of my sharp, firm eyes

00:22:51.090 --> 00:22:56.180
odoroite  anata wa damatta ne

00:22:51.090 --> 00:22:56.180
You were startled, and didn't say a word

00:22:56.680 --> 00:23:01.150
tooranakya ikenai michi wo

00:22:56.680 --> 00:23:01.150
You can't see what's in front of you

00:23:01.860 --> 00:23:06.400
saketecha  saki wa mienai janai

00:23:01.860 --> 00:23:06.400
If you walk off the road you have to go along

00:23:07.150 --> 00:23:11.700
GURUGURU to tada  mayoikomu yori mo

00:23:07.150 --> 00:23:11.700
Let's gather some courage and set this straight now

00:23:12.280 --> 00:23:17.910
hakkiri to ima  yuuki wo dasou yo

00:23:12.280 --> 00:23:17.910
Rather than walking around in circles

00:23:20.080 --> 00:23:24.590
Love Me Deeper  daite  kizutsuketai

00:23:20.080 --> 00:23:24.590
Love me deeper, hold me, I wanna hurt you

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:29.840
Touch Me, PINCH ni oitsumete ageru

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:29.840
ouch me, I'll pin you down with this pinch

00:23:30.510 --> 00:23:34.850
Deeper Deeper  hayaku  honki ni natte

00:23:30.510 --> 00:23:34.850
Deeper, deeper, quick  get real

00:23:35.720 --> 00:23:40.980
anata to naite mitai kara

00:23:35.720 --> 00:23:40.980
Because I wanna try crying with you

00:23:41.060 --> 00:23:45.440
Love Me Deeper  daite  umarekawatte

00:23:41.060 --> 00:23:45.440
Love me deeper, hold me, be reborn

00:23:46.150 --> 00:23:50.780
Hold Me, PINCH wo kirinukete hoshii

00:23:46.150 --> 00:23:50.780
Take me, I want you to get through this pinch

00:23:51.360 --> 00:23:55.830
Deeper Deeper  hayaku  me wo samashite

00:23:51.360 --> 00:23:55.830
Deeper, deeper, quick  open your eyes

00:23:56.580 --> 00:24:03.000
watashi hitori wo  sou aishite

00:23:56.580 --> 00:24:03.000
And make me  the only one you love
